Rule 4 (the reduced dimension must be non-empty)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= (v_2 ≥ 0 ∧ shape(v_1, v_2) > 0) ∨ (v_2 < 0 ∧ shape(v_1, v_2 + ndim(v_1)) > 0)
