Rule 5 (all shape dimensions are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = 0) ∨ (∀ i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0)
>>
Rule 6 (for 1-D inputs, only axes -1 or 0 are valid)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if ndim(v_1) = 1 then (v_2 = 0 ∨ v_2 = -1)
