Rule 9 (reduction axis must be non-empty after normalization)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, if v_2 ≥ 0 then v_2 else v_2 + ndim(v_1)) > 0
